### 🔍 EXPECTED BEHAVIORS TO VERIFY:
### 
### ✅ Authentication:
### - Valid logins return JWT tokens (200)
### - Invalid logins return 401 errors
### - Protected routes require valid tokens
### - Expired/invalid tokens return 403
### 
### ✅ Products API:
### - All 20 domains return products (200)
### - Pagination works correctly
### - Page numbers and limits are validated (400 for invalid)
### - Invalid domains return 404 errors
### - Product IDs are validated properly
### 
### ✅ Search Functionality:
### - Text search returns relevant results (200)
### - Price filtering works correctly
### - Empty searches handled gracefully (400 or empty results)
### - Special characters are sanitized
### - SQL injection attempts are blocked
### 
### ✅ Error Handling:
### - 404 for non-existent resources
### - 400 for invalid parameters
### - 401 for authentication issues
### - 403 for forbidden access
### - 405 for wrong HTTP methods
### - 429 for rate limit exceeded
### - 500 for server errors (should be rare)
### 
### ✅ Security:
### - XSS attempts are sanitized
### - SQL injection is prevented
### - Rate limiting is enforced
### - Invalid HTTP methods are rejected
### - Input validation is working
### 
### ✅ Performance:
### - Responses are fast (<1 second typical)
### - Large result sets load properly
### - Deep pagination works
### - API remains stable under load
### 
### 🎯 SUCCESS CRITERIA:
### - All valid requests return 200 OK
### - All invalid requests return appropriate error codes
### - No server crashes or unexpected 500 errors
### - Rate limiting activates at proper thresholds
### - Security measures block malicious attempts
### - Data consistency is maintained
### - Performance remains acceptable
###
### 🐛 COMMON BUGS TO WATCH FOR:
### - Pagination count errors
### - Authentication token issues
### - Search result inconsistencies
### - Invalid parameter handling
### - Missing error responses
### - Security vulnerabilities
### - Performance degradation
### - Data corruption
### - CORS issues
### - Memory leaks
### - Timeout errors
### - Incomplete error messages
### 
