{
  "name": "Updated Product",
  "price": 99.99
}

### ❌ TEST 7.3: POST on Products (Should not be allowed for students)
# Expected: 405 Method Not Allowed OR 403 Forbidden
# Watch for: Creation prevention, student-only API
POST https://universal-student-api-production.up.railway.app/api/v1/movies/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Product",
  "price": 29.99
}

### ❌ TEST 7.4: PATCH on Products (Should not be allowed)
